       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks like an error.\n\nIbuprofen 4000 mg four times daily comes to 16,000 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under prescriber supervision, and the usual limit is 1,200 mg/day over the counter. A dose that high risks serious GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day), a common dose\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day), often used for inflammatory conditions\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If 4000 mg per dose is what you intended, please confirm that explicitly and give me the clinical rationale for the order note."
